[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Resource_yqh1a"]
script = ExtResource("5_c85cf")
markedup_text = "Extend the road all the way to the capital."
requirement = SubResource("Resource_xwjmn")
outcome = SubResource("Resource_ps5l8")
markedup_result_text = "The final stakes are driven in. The surface is leveled. Signposts are set up.

Several houses will soon be converted into inns for travelers.

\"It's open,\" someone says. \"It begins now.\""

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Resource_2stvf"]
script = ExtResource("15_8qrn6")
card_type = ExtResource("14_b3020")
metadata/_custom_type_script = "uid://cqnoecri6xisf"

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Resource_r07ey"]
script = ExtResource("17_qi3vd")
aspect_type = ExtResource("16_etsi2")
min_count = 2

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Resource_ogssy"]
script = ExtResource("5_c85cf")
markedup_text = "Expand the road within the settlement."
requirement = SubResource("Resource_r07ey")
outcome = SubResource("Resource_2stvf")
markedup_result_text = "Rather than optimize for speed or state control, the group reroutes the road through gardens, commons, and gathering spots.

The path becomes slower, but warmer. People pause more. Talk more.

\"A road doesn't have to get you there fast. It just has to keep you together.\""

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Resource_xxhwh"]
script = ExtResource("15_8qrn6")
card_type = ExtResource("18_p7083")
metadata/_custom_type_script = "uid://cqnoecri6xisf"

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Resource_4rbn6"]
script = ExtResource("13_f6yki")
bonus_type = ExtResource("19_03m1t")
min_count = 25
max_count = -1
extra_per_season = 25

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Resource_7lpxr"]
script = ExtResource("5_c85cf")
markedup_text = "Split the road into forks leading into the wilderness."
requirement = SubResource("Resource_4rbn6")
outcome = SubResource("Resource_xxhwh")
markedup_result_text = "Instead of a single road, the path now splits into many forks. Some end in scenic vistas, others disappear into the rough wilderness.

Travel is not as efficient, but it carries folks off the beaten path.

\"The straight line was fastest. But this way, we'll actually see something.\""

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Resource_l4pg3"]
script = ExtResource("5_c85cf")
markedup_text = "Leave the road in its humble state."
markedup_result_text = "The stakes stay where they are. The grass grows back slowly.

\"Maybe the stillness was the point,\" someone says. \"For now.\""

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Resource_uw5fo"]
script = ExtResource("3_3bxsm")
markedup_text = "The path stretches further than it did yesterday.

Settlers have begun marking it with wooden stakes and bits of painted cloth. An inn is being planned.

An enterprising settler sets up a stall accepting messages to be delivered.

\"If we extend the road further, there's no telling who will come,\" one settler mutters."
background_image = SubResource("Resource_l2w87")
background_credit = ExtResource("11_anxfv")
choices = Array[ExtResource("5_c85cf")]([SubResource("Resource_yqh1a"), SubResource("Resource_ogssy"), SubResource("Resource_7lpxr")])
exit_choice = SubResource("Resource_l4pg3")

